OL,3,ABBC removes 11 Mitchell and Webb comedy
OL,4,Asketches from iPlayer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC has removed nearly a dozen
OL,7,Fcomedy sketches from That Mitchell and
OL,8,FWebb Look after deciding they no longer
OL,9,F"work today".
OL,11,FThe Bafta-winning comedy, written by
OL,12,Fand starring David Mitchell and Robert
OL,13,FWebb, originally ran for four seasons
OL,14,Fbetween 2006 and 2010.
OL,16,FThe show recently returned to the BBC's
OL,17,FiPlayer to mark its 20th anniversary.
OL,18,FBut 11 old sketches, including one that
OL,19,Freportedly showed the comedy duo
OL,20,Fsatirising racism while in blackface,
OL,21,Fhave now been cut.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1789998488
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABBC removes 11 Mitchell and Webb comedy
OL,4,Asketches from iPlayer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA BBC spokesman said in a statement:
OL,7,F"This is a 20-year-old sketch show; in
OL,8,Fconsultation with the programme makers,
OL,9,Fwe have included the ones that still
OL,10,Fwork today and not the ones that
OL,11,Fdon't."
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
